tes from server/templates with HTMX and Alpine loadedfrom a CDN. The app cannot do that: a self-hosted box must not depend on a third-party CDN, andoffline use needs local files. So vendor both libraries into the repo. The brand accent is #e94560.CHANGES (create these files):1. helix_codex_app/static/css/tokens.css — the design tokens exactly as listed in the master plan   section 8.1. One accent colour, one radius scale, one spacing scale, system font stack.2. helix_codex_app/static/css/app.css — the shell layout: header, content area, bottom nav on mobile,   a left rail at min-width 768px, toast host, and card/button/badge primitives. Mobile-first: base   rules target 375px, the media query adds the rail. No framework, no gradients. Every tap target   is at least 44px (--tap-min).3. helix_codex_app/static/vendor/htmx.min.js and helix_codex_app/static/vendor/alpine.min.js —   download the current stable minified builds and commit them. Add a short   helix_codex_app/static/vendor/README.md naming each file, its version, and its license.4. helix_codex_app/static/manifest.webmanifest — name "Helix Codex", short_name "Codex",   start_url "/app", display standalone, theme_color #e94560, background_color #ffffff, icons 192,   512, and a maskable 512.5. helix_codex_app/static/icons/icon-192.png, icon-512.png, maskable-512.png — generate simple   placeholder PNGs from the accent colour. Keep them small; they will be replaced before release.6. helix_codex_app/static/sw.js — precache the shell, tokens.css, app.css, both vendored libraries,   and the icons. Network-first for /app/api/*, cache-first for static assets. Serve offline.html   when a navigation request fails offline. Version the cache name so an update replaces it.7. helix_codex_app/static/offline.html — a plain page that says the app is offline and that the last   viewed pages are still readable.8. helix_codex_app/static/js/pwa.js — register the service worker, capture beforeinstallprompt, 